## 5. Final payment of accumulations in PF  
The amount standing at credit shall become payable when the  
subscriber-  
1. quits service;
2. is dismissed/ removed from service;
3. 3.
4. proceeds on leave preparatory to retirement;
5. permitted to retire or declared by a Competent
4. retires from service/ Medical Authority to be unfit for further service.
